---
interface Props {
  title: string;
  description?: string;
}
const { title, description = "Claude / Codex 桌面端国内镜像，每日同步最新版本与中文更新说明。" } = Astro.props;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Ctext y='52' font-size='52'%3E📦%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
    <style>
      :root {
        --fg: #0f172a;
        --fg-muted: #475569;
        --bg: #f8fafc;
        --card: #ffffff;
        --border: #e2e8f0;
        --accent: #2563eb;
        --code-bg: #f1f5f9;
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root {
          --fg: #e2e8f0;
          --fg-muted: #94a3b8;
          --bg: #0f172a;
          --card: #1e293b;
          --border: #334155;
          --accent: #60a5fa;
          --code-bg: #0b1220;
        }
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
        color: var(--fg);
        background: var(--bg);
        line-height: 1.65;
      }
      a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      header, footer {
        max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
      }
      header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
      header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; }
      header nav a { margin-left: 1rem; color: var(--fg-muted); }
      main { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem 1.25rem 3rem; }
      footer { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .card {
        background: var(--card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }
      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.15rem 0.55rem;
        background: var(--code-bg);
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--fg-muted);
      }
      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
        background: var(--accent);
        color: #fff !important;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        margin: 0.25rem 0.35rem 0.25rem 0;
      }
      .btn.secondary {
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--accent) !important;
        border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      }
      .meta { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }
      pre, code { font-family: "SF Mono", ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }
      pre {
        background: var(--code-bg); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; overflow-x: auto;
      }
      code { background: var(--code-bg); padding: 0.1em 0.35em; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em; }
      pre code { background: transparent; padding: 0; }
      details summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--fg-muted); }
      h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
      h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
      ul { padding-left: 1.4rem; }
      .grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <h1><a href="/" style="color: var(--fg)">📦 Claude / Codex 镜像</a></h1>
      <nav>
        <a href="/claude-desktop/">Claude Desktop</a>
        <a href="/codex-desktop/">Codex Desktop</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main>
      <slot />
    </main>
    <footer>
      <p>本站镜像 <strong>未经修改</strong> 的官方安装包，仅为方便国内用户下载。所有商标归原厂所有。</p>
      <p>每个安装包均提供 SHA-256 校验值与官方原始链接，可自行核验。如遇任何下架请求，本站将立即响应。</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
